# BuildKit reads this file for addon/Dockerfile in place of a .dockerignore at
# the build context, which is the repository root: the image needs engine/ as
# well as addon/, and nothing else.
*
!addon
!engine
**/node_modules
addon/build
addon/.react-router
addon/data

# Playwright's output, rewritten by every `npm run test:e2e` run and roughly
# 70% of the add-on's tree. The build stage does `COPY addon/ ./`, so leaving
# these in means running the tests invalidates the layer cache and forces a
# full reinstall and rebuild on the next image build, with nothing in the
# source having changed. Both are gitignored, so they never show up in
# `git status` to remind you they are here.
addon/playwright-report
addon/test-results
